# State records what Terraform believes exists. Lose it and Terraform forgets
# it built anything — `destroy` can no longer clean up, and you are deleting
# resources by hand in the console.
#
# Workspace states live in terraform.tfstate.d/<workspace>/, so this covers
# every environment at once.
.terraform/
terraform.tfstate.d/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
tfplan

# Written by `make apply`. Regenerated every time; never edit it.
inventory/
